> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528117-i-ve-been-taking-which-vtm-clan-i-belong-to-quiz-the-results-are-pretty-consistent?p=1537450#post1537450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What is the problem with Demetation?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a badly designed gimmick. Most powers within are either Watered Down Auspex or Watered Down Dominate, and the main powers are mostly unusable.<br /> <br /> Also, being based on the idea of madness being just seeing things + random bulshit, even if not played for laughs, it is still a huge disservice for representation of mental health issues and patients.<br /> <br /> Being myself both patient and professional, Dementation unerves me. And as game design it is just plain bad.<br /> <br /> My personal theory, though, is that it is bad on purpose because the Malkavians had otherwise the best spread in the whole game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-15T22:33:02-07:00","id":1537464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528117-i-ve-been-taking-which-vtm-clan-i-belong-to-quiz-the-results-are-pretty-consistent?p=1537463#post1537463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a badly designed gimmick. Most powers within are either Watered Down Auspex or Watered Down Dominate, and the main powers are mostly unusable.<br /> <br /> Also, being based on the idea of madness being just seeing things + random bulshit, even if not played for laughs, it is still a huge disservice for representation of mental health issues and patients.<br /> <br /> Being myself both patient and professional, Dementation unerves me. And as game design it is just plain bad.<br /> <br /> My personal theory, though, is that it is bad on purpose because the Malkavians had otherwise the best spread in the whole game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well before 3rd Edition, I adapted the Path of Morpheus from a Path to the Malkavian Discipline and had the Malkavians instead tied to dreams and illusion.<br /> <br /> I also have had them have Chimestry instead of Dementation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-16T08:47:44-07:00","id":1537492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528117-i-ve-been-taking-which-vtm-clan-i-belong-to-quiz-the-results-are-pretty-consistent?p=1537463#post1537463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a badly designed gimmick. Most powers within are either Watered Down Auspex or Watered Down Dominate, and the main powers are mostly unusable.<br /> <br /> Also, being based on the idea of madness being just seeing things + random bulshit, even if not played for laughs, it is still a huge disservice for representation of mental health issues and patients.<br /> <br /> Being myself both patient and professional, Dementation unerves me. And as game design it is just plain bad.<br /> <br /> My personal theory, though, is that it is bad on purpose because the Malkavians had otherwise the best spread in the whole game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Best spread?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-16T10:28:52-07:00","id":1537502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528117-i-ve-been-taking-which-vtm-clan-i-belong-to-quiz-the-results-are-pretty-consistent?p=1537464#post1537464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Well before 3rd Edition, I adapted the Path of Morpheus from a Path to the Malkavian Discipline and had the Malkavians instead tied to dreams and illusion.<br /> <br /> I also have had them have Chimestry instead of Dementation.</div> </div> </div> </div> Those are interesting approaches, but I personally like how Dominate lets you literally worm your way into the target's head and plant your personal vision of how they should behave.<br /> <br /> Dominate is a means to spread madness, and its fine control actually means doing a job tailored to your personal derangement or world view. When you get down to it, it's frighteningly more effective than Dementation at this job.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528117-i-ve-been-taking-which-vtm-clan-i-belong-to-quiz-the-results-are-pretty-consistent?p=1537492#post1537492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Best spread?</div> </div> </div> </div>Since you can learn any Physical Discipline without a donor of blood, they have less value as In-Clan to begin with (not a lack of value, just less). Also, while being a combat pro is an option, combat is usually a suboptimal approach to solve any problem.<br /> <br /> Auspex and Obfuscate make the Malkavians perfect spies, far better in potential than the Nosferatu. With one you can access any information around you, with the other you can be anywhere unnoticed, it's a combination made in heaven already.<br /> <br /> Dominate lets you play with the minds of everyone's toys, and even other vampires if you want and dare.<br /> <br /> Now picture all the ways you can combine those powers to make your life easier.<br /> <br /> They're considerably versatile Disciplines, work well in any combination between themselves, and you can still get the Physical Trio if you need. They're also incredibly practical.<br /> <br /> I'm sure there are better individual Disciplines for particular needs, and by no means this will be a combat powerhouse, but can you sure present another spread of three better than this?<br /> <br /> Malkavian is a broken clan if done seriously.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-16T10:45:38-07:00","id":1537505,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528117-i-ve-been-taking-which-vtm-clan-i-belong-to-quiz-the-results-are-pretty-consistent?p=1537502#post1537502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Those are interesting approaches, but I personally like how Dominate lets you literally worm your way into the target's head and plant your personal vision of how they should behave.<br /> <br /> Dominate is a means to spread madness, and its fine control actually means doing a job tailored to your personal derangement or world view. When you get down to it, it's frighteningly more effective than Dementation at this job.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, part of why I changed it is that I never used Dominate that way. You can't use Dominate to drive someone insane. You can't use dominate to change someone's opinion.<br /> <br /> At least in my games.<br /> <br /> Presence is how you get someone to feel something differently.<br /> <br /> Dominant in my games may get someone to empty their bank accounts but I don't think I'd allow is to say, &quot;And you feel great about it.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-16T11:33:26-07:00","id":1537511,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528117-i-ve-been-taking-which-vtm-clan-i-belong-to-quiz-the-results-are-pretty-consistent?p=1537502#post1537502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Those are interesting approaches, but I personally like how Dominate lets you literally worm your way into the target's head and plant your personal vision of how they should behave.<br /> <br /> Dominate is a means to spread madness, and its fine control actually means doing a job tailored to your personal derangement or world view. When you get down to it, it's frighteningly more effective than Dementation at this job.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Since you can learn any Physical Discipline without a donor of blood, they have less value as In-Clan to begin with (not a lack of value, just less). Also, while being a combat pro is an option, combat is usually a suboptimal approach to solve any problem.<br /> <br /> Auspex and Obfuscate make the Malkavians perfect spies, far better in potential than the Nosferatu. With one you can access any information around you, with the other you can be anywhere unnoticed, it's a combination made in heaven already.<br /> <br /> Dominate lets you play with the minds of everyone's toys, and even other vampires if you want and dare.<br /> <br /> Now picture all the ways you can combine those powers to make your life easier.<br /> <br /> They're considerably versatile Disciplines, work well in any combination between themselves, and you can still get the Physical Trio if you need. They're also incredibly practical.<br /> <br /> I'm sure there are better individual Disciplines for particular needs, and by no means this will be a combat powerhouse, but can you sure present another spread of three better than this?<br /> <br /> Malkavian is a broken clan if done seriously.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mechanically it seems okay, but I think Demetation suits the Malkavians much more contextually, even if the discipline needs improvement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-16T11:51:46-07:00","id":1537512,"title":"","content":"I wasn\u2019t a big fan of the Dementation power myself and prefer it as a amalgam power if I would use it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-16T12:02:14-07:00","id":1537514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528117-i-ve-been-taking-which-vtm-clan-i-belong-to-quiz-the-results-are-pretty-consistent?p=1537452#post1537452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It said I'm Nosferatu and then Brujah. Clearly it knows NOTHING! NOTHING!</div> </div> </div> </div>To bad that you are having a tough time with that quiz, I keep on getting Malkavian, Ministry and now Ravnos. Though on other quizzes I got Tremere of all clans.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-16T12:36:53-07:00","id":1537518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528117-i-ve-been-taking-which-vtm-clan-i-belong-to-quiz-the-results-are-pretty-consistent?p=1537505#post1537505\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Eh, part of why I changed it is that I never used Dominate that way. You can't use Dominate to drive someone insane. You can't use dominate to change someone's opinion.<br /> <br /> At least in my games.<br /> <br /> Presence is how you get someone to feel something differently.<br /> <br /> Dominant in my games may get someone to empty their bank accounts but I don't think I'd allow is to say, &quot;And you feel great about it.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> You can modify behavior, and RAW the victim has no idea of why they did it. You can modify memories, which can cause all sorts of disconnections between what the person remember being real and reality itself. You don't really need more than that to drive someone crazy.<br /> <br /> &quot;Direct&quot; madness easily causes the problem of random bulshit. It is cool on paper, terrible in practice. It's better to have the character organically break from known factors, so the actual problem and the method to their madness is known.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-17T12:45:49-07:00","id":1537574,"title":"","content":"Yes the Malkavian have a great Discipline spread just after the Followers of Set Ministry spread as it work quite well with what they meant for and I would thrown in Ravnos and the Tzismce clans in the same mix.<br /> <br /> My listing is as follows.<br /> <br /> 1st. Followers of Set/Ministry<br /> 2nd. Malkavians<br /> 3rd. Ravnos<br /> 4th: Tzismce.<br /> 5th: Gangrel","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 06-17-2024, 08:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-17T15:58:05-07:00","id":1537588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528117-i-ve-been-taking-which-vtm-clan-i-belong-to-quiz-the-results-are-pretty-consistent?p=1537574#post1537574\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes the Malkavian have a great Discipline spread just after the Followers of Set Ministry spread as it work quite well with what they meant for and I would thrown in Ravnos and the Tzismce clans in the same mix. <br /> My listing is as follows.<br /> <br /> 1st. Followers of Set/Ministry<br /> 2nd. Malkavians<br /> 3rd. Ravnos<br /> 4th: Tzismce.<br /> 5: Gangrel</div> </div> </div> </div> As far as optimization goes, I think the Ministry isn't that well served. Serpentis/Protean simply doesn't have that synergy with their shtick.<br /> <br /> Not that I would have anything else, of course, it's cool and still useful, just not as synergic. It's still a good spread.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-18T13:47:36-07:00","id":1537633,"title":"","content":"Given the Followers Of Set/Ministry love of collecting secrets and trading lore you could argue that there clan spread could be Auspex, Obfsucate and Presence, but it might've not have worked as well in the long run.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-20T06:38:05-07:00","id":1537701,"title":"","content":"I took the one on the current World of Darkness site and came out as Ravnos<br /> answering more as the vampire I would like to play instead of how me real person would answer.<br /> A few friends I sent it came out with fitting results as well.<br /> So I feel it's a good one. XD","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Ever since the Followers of Set rebranded themselves as The Ministry, I can barely keep a straight face around them.&quot; - Ramona","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15944-ravnos","name":"Ravnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15944_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-29T12:36:31-07:00","id":1537873,"title":"","content":"I answered as honestly as I could and I would get Malkavian, Ministry, Ravnos as the most frequent results with Gangrel and Brujah a distant second and I would be shocked if I got Lasombra, Ventrue, Tremere or the Fiends at all Mr. Ravnos.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}